# The ruling of Opalescence and Humility (2009-10-01), Warleader's Call in Worship's place: Opalescence (turn 3) entered
# before Humility (turn 5). Layer 4: Humility and Warleader's Call become creatures that are still enchantments
# (Opalescence). Layer 6: they lose their abilities (Humility) - Warleader's Call's "Creatures you control get +1/+1"
# among them. Layer 7b, in timestamp order (CR 613.7): Opalescence makes Humility 4/4 and Warleader's Call 3/3 (their
# mana values), then Humility makes both 1/1 - its own effect goes on applying though it took its own ability (CR 613.6).
# Both end 1/1: 2/2 if Warleader's Call's +1/+1 had stayed, 4/4 and 3/3 if Opalescence's 7b part came last.
# Opalescence itself is no creature. Before Humility, Warleader's Call is a 4/4: base 3/3 and its own +1/+1.

